COPY public."Policies" ("PolicyId", "Slug", "Title", "Content", "UpdatedAt") FROM stdin;
1	shipping	Shipping Policy	We ship to all addresses provided at checkout. Orders are typically processed within 1-2 business days and delivered within 5-7 business days domestically. Shipping costs, if any, are calculated at checkout.	2026-09-25 13:46:51.649604
2	returns	Return Policy	Items can be returned within 14 days of delivery if unused and in original packaging. To start a return, contact support with your order number. Refunds are issued to the original payment method within 5-10 business days of us receiving the returned item.	2026-09-25 13:46:51.649604
3	cancellation	Cancellation Policy	Orders can be cancelled only while their status is "Confirmed" (i.e. before they have shipped). Once an order moves to "Shipped", it can no longer be cancelled through the app. Cancelling a paid order automatically restores stock and triggers a refund to your original payment method.	2026-09-25 13:46:51.649604
4	payment	Payment Policy	We accept payment via credit and debit cards through Stripe. Your card is charged at the time of checkout. Refunds for cancelled or returned orders are processed back to the same card and typically appear within 5-10 business days.	2026-09-25 13:46:51.649604
5	guest-checkout	Guest Checkout	You can check out without creating an account using a valid email address. Your order confirmation and any status updates will be sent to that email. Guest orders are limited to a smaller number of distinct items per order compared to logged-in checkout; if you shop frequently, creating an account is recommended for full order history and easier tracking.	2026-09-25 13:46:51.649604
6	reviews	Review Policy	Only customers who have purchased and received a product (order status "Delivered") can leave a review for it. All reviews are automatically screened for spam, advertising, and abusive content before publishing; some reviews may be held for manual approval if the automated check is uncertain.	2026-09-25 13:46:51.649604
